              {
                "message_id": "35893c6b-bd74-4c6b-8135-550a2625ac3d",
                "quote": "如果大家都接受可以為了多數犧牲一個人，那社會會很可怕。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 27
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 1,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": []
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 2,
            "score": 1.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "3495bac1-3c3e-4e8f-99dd-d4ee8295986c",
                "quote": "要守住不能犧牲人的規則。",
                "start": 6,
                "end": 18
              },
              {
                "message_id": "48233a9d-a7a2-4151-926f-185b17627424",
                "quote": "今天是電車，明天醫院就可以拿一個健康的人的器官救五個病人。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 29
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 3,
            "score": 0.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "3640ac18-83e2-4756-bcd3-39817655d034",
                "quote": "這會開很壞的先例",
                "start": 8,
                "end": 16
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 4,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "student_id": "8b24fdd5-f6a7-44e0-80f6-188ea16a6926",
        "display_name": "謝承恩",
        "scores": [
          {
            "dimension_index": 0,
            "score": 0.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "e4e8c5b0-9246-4cfd-b50b-06a778ab3147",
                "quote": "犧牲別人不對",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 6
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 1,
            "score": 1.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "f2d5fb89-c95f-40c9-bfee-75f0169781de",
                "quote": "不要拉也不要害別人",
                "start": 15,
                "end": 24
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 2,
            "score": 1.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "27630158-b982-426f-91bc-1e0488325336",
                "quote": "至少我不用決定別人的命",
                "start": 11,
                "end": 22
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 3,
            "score": 1.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "9cf2e80a-aac6-4ee1-9885-585e1e87715c",
                "quote": "我會自己跳下去，不推他。",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 12
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 4,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "student_id": "36533e02-2f67-44ed-8596-019b2cb30279",
        "display_name": "羅冠廷",
        "scores": [
          {
            "dimension_index": 0,
            "score": 1.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "072e275b-22bb-4c18-b443-3755e1c974a8",
                "quote": "把風險轉到不知情的人身上不公平",
                "start": 6,
                "end": 21
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 1,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "072e275b-22bb-4c18-b443-3755e1c974a8",
                "quote": "我不拉",
                "start": 2,
                "end": 5
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 2,
            "score": 1.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "db7e026e-146e-417c-a0f2-52b6a1073f94",
                "quote": "天橋上的人跟這件事完全無關",
                "start": 3,
                "end": 16
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 3,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": [
              {
                "message_id": "aabe64db-1dc6-47ec-9296-3443858c9685",
                "quote": "另一條軌道那個人可能以為那裡是安全的",
                "start": 0,
                "end": 18
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "dimension_index": 4,
            "score": 2.0,
            "sources": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
